# Keep the build context lean. The image builds from source and initialises
# genesis at first boot, so none of this is needed inside it.
#
# Note what is NOT excluded: openapi/static and openapi/template are embedded by
# openapi/openapi.go with //go:embed, so excluding them breaks the build with
# "pattern static: no matching files found". third_party carries the verifier
# sources and checksums.
.git
.github
build
